          "argument": "",
          "argument_optional": false,
          "summary": "Show the command usage",
          "detail": "--help prints the same usage after this subcommand. --help-all requests the full option list. Both Ubuntu packages print the same text for all three spellings."
        },
        {
          "flag": "--no-index",
          "argument": "",
          "argument_optional": false,
          "summary": "Restore changes without recreating the saved staging state",
          "detail": "Overrides --index and, on Git 2.53 and current upstream, stash.index=true. A conflict can still leave unmerged index entries."
